{title: Let Us Break Bread Together}
{artist: Traditional spiritual}
{genre: Gospel, Communion}
{style: Spiritual}
{flow: Response}
{key: F}
{key_original: Eb}
{tempo: 66}
{time: 4/4}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 231장}
{title_ko: 우리 다 같이 무릎 꿇고서}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Let us break bread together on our [Bb]knees
Let us break [F]bread together on our [C7]knees
When I fall on my knees with my face to the rising [F]sun
O Lord, have [C7]mercy on [F]me
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Let us drink wine together on our [Bb]knees
Let us drink [F]wine together on our [C7]knees
When I fall on my knees with my face to the rising [F]sun
O Lord, have [C7]mercy on [F]me
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]Let us praise God together on our [Bb]knees
Let us praise [F]God together on our [C7]knees
When I fall on my knees with my face to the rising [F]sun
O Lord, have [C7]mercy on [F]me
{end_of_verse}
